[_description]
Package: com.snowgears.shop.listener. CreativeSelectionListener with creative mode protection methods and public isCreativeSelectionMode checks.

[_careful]

[_careful/Compatibility]
Creative selection state is tracked per-player and per-UUID. State restoration on death/respawn is enforced to prevent stuck selection mode.

[_conclusions]
Listeners provide protection layers during creative selection and shop interactions, preventing unintended player actions.

